
                                                  CONFIG CB MERGE COMMAND


Config CB Merge command implements the Merge functionality for CB merge.


----------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SWITCHES        |    DESCRIPTION
----------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   -in_t        |    Template input XML file.
   -in          |    Input XML file.
   -rule_t      |    Template rules XML file.
   -rule        |    Input rules XML file.
   -out_t       |    Template output XML file.
   -out         |    Output XML file.
   -info        |    Input XML file for infoblock cb.
   -info_t      |    Template input XML file for infoblock.
   -prj_hex     |    Input HEX file for CB .
   -all_hex     |    lst file which contains list of all HEX input files.
   -hex         |    Input hex file for CB.
   -hexmod_log  |    Log file for Hexmod CB.
   -cb_hex      |    Input HEX file for CB.
   -cb_split_hex|    Input HEX file for split CB without config.
   -hexmod18    |    To identify it is MDG1 project.
   -abm_out     |    Output XML file for ABM gen.
   -abm_t       |    Template XML file ABM.   
----------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Example:
        
--core_exp         _gen/swb/module/coreproc/filelist_gen_merged_exp.txt
--rule_t           _gen/swb/module/hexmod/RULES.XT
--rule             _gen/swb/module/hexmod/rule_debug_cb.xml
--in_t             _gen/swb/module/hexmod/INPUT.XT
--in               _gen/swb/module/hexmod/input_debug_cb.xml
--info_t           _gen/swb/module/hexmod/INFOBLOCK.XT
--info             _gen/swb/module/hexmod/infoblock_debug_cb.xml
--out_t            _gen/swb/module/hexmod/OUTPUT.XT
--out              _gen/swb/module/hexmod/output_debug_cb.xml
--abm_t            _gen/swb/module/hexmod/ABM.XT
--info_check_t  _gen/swb/module/hexmod/INFOBLOCK_CHECK.XT
--abm_out          _gen/swb/module/hexmod/abm_gen.xml
--all_hex          _gen/swb/module/hexmod/all_hex_files.lst
--prj_hex          _gen/swb/module/hexmod/cb_src.hex
--hex              _bin/swb/cb_debug.hex
--cb_hex           _bin/swb/cb.hex
--cb_split_hex     _bin/swb/cb_withoutconfig.hex
--hexmod18         
--overwrite        
--info_check    _gen/swb/module/hexmod/info_check/infoblock_check_merge.lst
--hexmod_log        _log/swb/module/hexmod/hexmod_debug_cb.log
--logfile           _log/swb/module/hexmod/config_hexmod_debug_cb.log